# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT PUBLISHED. This repo is public and serves a GitHub Page, so the raw
# radiology reports and the generated bundle of their text stay local-only.
# They carry physician names, accession numbers, ICD codes and ages that the
# curated findings in assets/js/data.js deliberately leave out.
# The app detects their absence and hides the "full report" expander.
# Regenerate the bundle locally with: node tools/build-reports.mjs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/scans-txt/
assets/js/reports.js

# Dependencies (the app itself has none; tools/ run on bare node)
node_modules/
package-lock.json

